"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">15</div><h1>전치사 2 — 3·4격 지배와 장소 표현</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wechselpräpositionen und Ortsangaben</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 15의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">아홉 전치사 뒤에서 Wo?(위치)면 3격, Wohin?(방향)이면 4격을 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">stellen/stehen · legen/liegen · setzen/sitzen · hängen을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">나라·도시·사람·섬·바다에 맞는 '가는 곳·있는 곳·온 곳' 전치사를 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">말하는 사람을 기준으로 hin과 her를 골라요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Die Fahrräder stehen unter <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Treppe.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) der</button></div><div class=\"qe\">서 있는 위치(Wo?)라서 3격이에요.<br>die Treppe(여성) → unter der Treppe.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ich lege die Zeitung auf <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Stuhl · 남성)</span> Stuhl.</div><div class=\"qko\">신문을 의자 위에 놓아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich lege die Zeitung auf <b>den</b> Stuhl.</div>legen(놓다)은 어디로 옮기는 동작(Wohin?)이라서 4격이에요 — auf den Stuhl.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Ein Vogel sitzt auf <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Dach · 중성)</span> Dach.</div><div class=\"qko\">새 한 마리가 지붕 위에 앉아 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ein Vogel sitzt auf <b>dem</b> Dach.</div>sitzen(앉아 있다)은 위치(Wo?)라서 3격이에요 — auf dem Dach.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Die Kinder rennen in <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Garten · 남성)</span> Garten.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들이 정원 안으로 뛰어 들어가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Kinder rennen in <b>den</b> Garten.</div>밖에서 정원 안으로 들어가는 방향(Wohin?)이라서 4격이에요 — in den Garten.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;die&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Wir hängen die Uhr über <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Tür · 여성)</span> Tür.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 시계를 문 위에 걸어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir hängen die Uhr über <b>die</b> Tür.</div>hängen이 '걸다'(목적어 die Uhr가 있음)라서 Wohin? → 4격이에요.<br>여성 4격 → über die Tür.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;],[&quot;Fenstern&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Zwischen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(정관사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Fenster · 복수)</span> steht ein Regal.</div><div class=\"qko\">창문들 사이에 선반이 하나 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Zwischen <b>den</b> <b>Fenstern</b> steht ein Regal.</div>steht는 위치(Wo?)라서 3격이에요.<br>복수 3격은 관사 den과 명사 끝 -n → zwischen den Fenstern.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die Vase auf das Regal.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) stelle</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) liege</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) stehe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sitze</button></div><div class=\"qe\">4격 목적어(die Vase)와 Wohin?(auf das Regal)이 있으니 옮기는 동사예요.<br>stehen·liegen·sitzen은 목적어 없이 놓여 있는 상태라서 맞지 않아요. 꽃병은 세워 두니까 stellen이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Mein Mantel <span class=\"qblank\"></span> an der Garderobe.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) steht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) liegt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) hängt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) stellt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">옷걸이에 걸려 있는 상태(Wo? → an der Garderobe, 3격)예요.<br>hängen은 '걸다'와 '걸려 있다'의 현재형이 같아요 — er hängt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;liegt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Deine Brille <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(liegen / legen)</span> neben dem Computer.</div><div class=\"qko\">네 안경은 컴퓨터 옆에 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Deine Brille <b>liegt</b> neben dem Computer.</div>목적어 없이 놓여 있는 상태(neben dem Computer, 3격)라서 liegen이에요.<br>안경은 눕혀 두는 물건이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;lege&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(legen / liegen)</span> das Baby ins Bett.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 아기를 침대에 눕혀요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich <b>lege</b> das Baby ins Bett.</div>4격 목적어(das Baby)와 Wohin?(ins Bett = in das Bett)이 있으니 legen(눕히다)이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Nächsten Sommer fliegen wir <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Türkei.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) nach der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) in die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) in der</button></div><div class=\"qe\">die Türkei처럼 관사가 있는 나라는 nach가 아니라 in + 4격으로 가요 — in die Türkei.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Am Abend sitzen wir auf dem Balkon&quot;,&quot;Wir sitzen am Abend auf dem Balkon&quot;,&quot;Auf dem Balkon sitzen wir am Abend&quot;,&quot;Wir sitzen auf dem Balkon am Abend&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">저녁에 우리는 발코니에 앉아 있어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Abend</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">auf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">sitzen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Balkon</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Am Abend sitzen wir auf dem Balkon.</b></div>sitzen은 위치(Wo?)라서 auf dem Balkon(3격)이에요.<br>am Abend가 앞에 오면 동사 sitzen 다음에 주어 wir가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Im August fahren meine Eltern an <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(See · 남성)</span> See.</div><div class=\"qko\">8월에 우리 부모님은 호수로 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im August fahren meine Eltern an <b>den</b> See.</div>호수·바다로 가는 방향은 an + 4격이에요.<br>der See → an den See.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Am Samstag gehen wir auf <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Flohmarkt · 남성)</span> Flohmarkt.</div><div class=\"qko\">토요일에 우리는 벼룩시장에 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Am Samstag gehen wir auf <b>den</b> Flohmarkt.</div>시장·광장으로 가는 방향은 auf + 4격이에요 — auf den Flohmarkt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> (마당에 있는 내가 집 안의 아이들에게) Kommt <span class=\"qblank\"></span>! 밖으로 나와!</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) hinein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) heraus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hinaus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) herein</button></div><div class=\"qe\">말하는 사람(나)이 밖에 있고 아이들이 나에게 오니까 her-예요.<br>밖으로 → heraus.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Wo ist der Keller? — <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. Die Treppe ist links.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Unten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Hinunter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Herunter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Nach unten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Wo?(어디에 있나)에는 위치 부사 unten을 써요.<br>hinunter·herunter·nach unten은 방향(Wohin?)이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;],[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Ich trage die Kisten in <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Keller · 남성)</span> Keller. Dort stelle ich sie auf <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Boden · 남성)</span> Boden.</div><div class=\"qko\">상자들을 지하실로 옮겨요. 거기서 상자들을 바닥에 내려놓아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich trage die Kisten in <b>den</b> Keller. Dort stelle ich sie auf <b>den</b> Boden.</div>둘 다 옮기는 동작(Wohin?)이라서 4격이에요.<br>이미 지하실 안에 있어도 stellen은 '어디로 놓나'를 말하니까 auf den Boden이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Jeden Morgen joggt Paula <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Stadtpark. (공원 안에서 달려요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) im</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ins</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) in den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">공원 안에서만 움직이면 위치(Wo?)라서 3격이에요 — in dem → im Stadtpark.<br>밖에서 공원 안으로 달려 들어갈 때만 in den이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;das&quot;],[&quot;liegt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Wohin hast du den Schlüssel gelegt? — Neben <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Telefon · 중성)</span> Telefon. — Da <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(liegen / legen)</span> er nicht!</div><div class=\"qko\">열쇠를 어디에 놓았어? — 전화기 옆에. — 거기 없는데!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wohin hast du den Schlüssel gelegt? — Neben <b>das</b> Telefon. — Da <b>liegt</b> er nicht!</div>Wohin?에 대한 대답이라서 4격 neben das Telefon이에요.<br>두 번째는 놓여 있는 상태라서 liegen → er liegt예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Stell die Milch bitte in den Kühlschrank&quot;,&quot;Stell bitte die Milch in den Kühlschrank&quot;,&quot;Bitte stell die Milch in den Kühlschrank&quot;,&quot;Stell die Milch in den Kühlschrank bitte&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우유를 냉장고에 넣어 줘!</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Milch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Kühlschrank</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">bitte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Stell</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Stell die Milch bitte in den Kühlschrank!</b></div>명령형 stell이 맨 앞에 와요.<br>우유팩은 세워 두니까 stellen, 넣는 방향이라서 in den Kühlschrank(4격)예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Lukas kommt gerade <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (시장에서 오는 길이에요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) auf dem Wochenmarkt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zum Wochenmarkt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) vom Wochenmarkt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) aus dem Wochenmarkt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">시장은 auf로 가고(auf den Markt) auf에 있고(auf dem Markt) von으로 와요.<br>von + dem → vom Wochenmarkt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;in die&quot;],[&quot;auf die&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Im Juli fliegt meine Cousine <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(관사 있는 나라 · 복수)</span> USA, und ich fahre <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(섬 · 여성)</span> Insel Rügen.</div><div class=\"qko\">7월에 내 사촌은 미국에 가고, 나는 뤼겐섬에 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im Juli fliegt meine Cousine <b>in die</b> USA, und ich fahre <b>auf die</b> Insel Rügen.</div>관사 있는 나라로 가면 in + 4격 → in die USA예요.<br>섬으로 가면 auf + 4격 → auf die Insel이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Ball ist hinter den Schrank gerollt&quot;,&quot;Hinter den Schrank ist der Ball gerollt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">공이 장롱 뒤로 굴러갔어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Schrank</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Ball</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hinter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">gerollt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Der</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Ball ist hinter den Schrank gerollt.</b></div>굴러서 장롱 뒤로 간 방향이라서 hinter den Schrank(4격)예요.<br>rollen은 이동이라서 sein과 현재완료를 만들어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> meinen Sohn auf den Stuhl. Jetzt <span class=\"qblank\"></span> er da und isst.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sitze … setzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) setze … setzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) setze … sitzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sitze … sitzt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">아들을 의자에 앉히는 동작은 setzen + 4격(auf den Stuhl)이에요.<br>그다음 앉아 있는 상태는 sitzen이에요 — er sitzt.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;],[&quot;gestellt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> Das Fahrrad steht jetzt im Hof. Gestern Abend hat Opa es in <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Hof · 남성)</span> Hof <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(stellen / stehen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">자전거는 지금 마당에 있어요. 어제저녁에 할아버지가 그것을 마당에 세워 두었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Fahrrad steht jetzt im Hof. Gestern Abend hat Opa es in <b>den</b> Hof <b>gestellt</b>.</div>할아버지가 자전거를 옮긴 동작이라서 stellen + 4격 → in den Hof예요.<br>stellen은 규칙 동사라서 과거분사가 gestellt예요. stehen이면 gestanden이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;in der&quot;],[&quot;bei&quot;],[&quot;zu&quot;],[&quot;zu&quot;],[&quot;nach&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Letzte Woche war ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(관사 있는 나라)</span> Schweiz, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> meiner Freundin. Jetzt bin ich wieder <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> Hause, und morgen fahre ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"> meinem Onkel <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"> Hamburg.</div><div class=\"qko\">지난주에 나는 스위스의 여자 친구 집에 있었어요. 지금은 다시 집에 있고, 내일은 함부르크의 삼촌 댁에 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Letzte Woche war ich <b>in der</b> Schweiz, <b>bei</b> meiner Freundin. Jetzt bin ich wieder <b>zu</b> Hause, und morgen fahre ich <b>zu</b> meinem Onkel <b>nach</b> Hamburg.</div>관사 있는 나라에 있으면 in der Schweiz, 사람 집에 있으면 bei예요.<br>집에 있으면 zu Hause예요.<br>사람에게 가면 zu meinem Onkel, 도시로 가면 nach Hamburg예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Das Handy hat gestern auf dem Sofa gelegt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Kinder sind in den See gesprungen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wir haben die Gläser in den Schrank gestellt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Das Bild hat lange an der Wand gehangen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">놓여 있던 상태는 liegen이라서 과거분사가 gelegen이에요 — Das Handy hat auf dem Sofa gelegen.<br>gelegt는 '눕혀 놓았다'(legen)예요. 걸려 있던 상태의 hängen은 gehangen이 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> 격이 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Sie hat das Poster über das Bett gehängt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Er hat den Schlüssel unter der Matte gelegt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Er ist ins Wasser gesprungen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir haben im Garten Fußball gespielt.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">legen은 어디로 놓는지(Wohin?)를 말하니까 4격이에요 — unter die Matte.<br>정원 안에서 노는 것은 위치라서 im Garten이 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wo fährst du am Wochenende hin&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">주말에 어디 가?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Wo</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Wochenende</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">fährst</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wo fährst du am Wochenende hin?</b></div>말할 때는 wohin을 wo … hin으로 나누어 hin을 문장 끝에 놓기도 해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> (내가 지하실에 있어요. 위층의 딸에게) Bring mir bitte die Taschenlampe <span class=\"qblank\"></span>!</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) hinauf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) herauf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hinunter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) herunter</button></div><div class=\"qe\">손전등이 아래에 있는 나(말하는 사람) 쪽으로 오니까 her-예요.<br>위에서 아래로 오니까 herunter예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"